{% set campus = true %}
{% from "modules/h1_requests/templates/_macros.html.j2" import signature %}
<p>{{ salutation(gender, first_name, last_name) }},</p>
<p>the replacement for your device <strong>{{ model }}</strong> (asset tag <strong>{{ asset_tag }}</strong>) has <strong>still not been ordered</strong>. The lease ends on <strong>{{ retirement_date | date }}</strong> ({% if days_left > 0 %}{{ days_left }} days left{% elif days_left == 0 %}ends today{% else %}{{ -days_left }} days overdue{% endif %}).</p>
<p>Devices returned after the end of the lease cause additional rental costs for {{ client_name }}, and late returns may incur penalty fees from the lessor.</p>
<p><strong>Please order the replacement in the ITSM portal today.</strong></p>
{% if campus %}<p>{% if campus %}As you work on the Campus, you can also bring the device to the Campus service point, or reply to this mail to arrange a desk visit.{% endif %}</p>{% endif %}
{{ signature(operator_name) }}
